<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 261 MLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 261 MLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 111 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills and 150 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 111 and 171 million of the bills respectively, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield for the shorter paper was flat at 22.00 percent. The average yield for the longer paper was also flat at 21.99 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
